-- Five citizens described only by their numbers: gold, health, stamina, weight, speed. Nothing here is a tag; every predicate is a value comparison, column against scalar or column against column.
--! registry ../registries/007-value-predicates.reg
--! expect gold = 600 700 600 100 90
--! expect greedy = 1 1 0 1 1
--! expect speed = 4 6 4 1 10

Gold == 500 , Gold += 100
Gold > Health * 10 , +Greedy
Stamina < Weight , Speed *= 0.5
